			"notes": "${{\\color{green}{\\textsf{Just Enough Serverless Recipes v0.1.0.0}}}}$\n---\n- Added Minecraft 26.3 support for Fabric and NeoForge.\n- Removed recipe injection and bundled vanilla recipes; JEI now provides the recipes.\n- Shift-click recipe transfers now move whole stacks when there are enough items to fill every required recipe slot.\n- Reduced pickup and return packets for smaller recipe transfers.\n---\n${{\\color{green}{\\textsf{Required client setup:}}}}$\n---\n- Fabric support:\n  - Fabric Loader `>=0.19.0`\n  - Fabric API `>=0.156.3+26.3`\n- NeoForge support:\n  - NeoForge `>=26.3.0.1-beta <26.4`\n- JEI support: `>=31.9.0.56`\n---\n${{\\color{green}{\\textsf{Minecraft compatibility:}}}}$\n---\n- 26.3 - Fabric & NeoForge compatibility."
		},
